WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.522
Part twelve.

00:00:01.522 --> 00:00:04.141
Hotkeys, backup and settings.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:08.634
Finally, the things you set once, in the Settings tab.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:14.296
Allow on all tabs switches Pocket QA on everywhere, so you never turn it on tab by tab.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.696
Hotkeys for recording and for every kind of capture, all changeable.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:28.016
How captures are saved: straight away or ask first, a file name prefix, a countdown, and a watermark with the URL and the time.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:34.267
Notifications by category, plus import, export, and a full backup and restore.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.100
And a dark theme, just one click away.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:48.264
From one recording, we now have a test that checks its own results, runs against a data table and exports to code, plus tools for APIs and databases.

00:00:48.264 --> 00:00:49.966
All of it right in your browser.
